"""
Air drawn by the cylinders, by speed-density: a four-stroke fills its displacement once every
two revolutions.

    mdot_cyl = eta_v p_m V_d N / (120 R T_m)          N in rpm
    eta_v    = eta_fl(N) (1 - k + k p_m / p_ref)
    eta_fl   = c0 + c1 nu + c2 nu^2,  nu = N / 1000 rpm, N clamped to n_min..n_max

This volumetric efficiency is the one the engine maps in `data/engine/` were derived with
(`eta_v_coeffs.csv`), so the air the cylinders draw here and the fuel the maps meter give the
map's lambda. `eta_fl` is the full-load breathing curve; the load factor lowers `eta_v` at part
load, to about 0.37 at idle. With 0 < k < 1 the air flow rises strictly with `p_m`.
"""
component CylinderAirflow
  "Manifold absolute pressure [Pa]"
  p_m = RealInput()
  "Engine speed [rad/s]"
  omega = RealInput()
  "Air mass flow into the cylinders [kg/s]"
  mdot_cyl = RealOutput()
  "Displacement (MathWorks)"
  parameter V_d::Volume = 1.5e-3
  "Manifold air temperature (MathWorks)"
  parameter T_m::Temperature = 298.15
  "Gas constant of air [J/(kg.K)] (textbook)"
  parameter R::Real = 287.05
  "Full-load breathing, constant term (derived, data/engine/eta_v_coeffs.csv)"
  parameter c0::Real = 0.777026
  "Full-load breathing, linear term [1/krpm] (derived, data/engine/eta_v_coeffs.csv)"
  parameter c1::Real = 0.148753
  "Full-load breathing, quadratic term [1/krpm^2] (derived, data/engine/eta_v_coeffs.csv)"
  parameter c2::Real = -0.020452
  "Load sensitivity of eta_v (derived, data/engine/eta_v_coeffs.csv)"
  parameter k::Real = 0.898877
  "Full-load manifold pressure the breathing curve refers to (assumed)"
  parameter p_ref::Pressure = 95000.0
  "Lowest speed of the breathing fit [rpm] (assumed)"
  parameter n_min::Real = 500.0
  "Highest speed of the breathing fit [rpm] (assumed)"
  parameter n_max::Real = 6750.0
  "Engine speed [rpm]"
  variable N::Real
  "Full-load volumetric efficiency"
  variable eta_fl::Real
  "Volumetric efficiency"
  variable eta_v::Real
relations
  N = omega * 30 / pi
  eta_fl = c0 + c1 * (min(max(N, n_min), n_max) / 1000) + c2 * (min(max(N, n_min), n_max) / 1000)^2
  eta_v = eta_fl * (1 - k + k * p_m / p_ref)
  mdot_cyl = eta_v * p_m * V_d * N / (120 * R * T_m)
end
